{
  "summary": "For a $100,000 business purchase, the strongest documented option is the Business Gold Rewards Card if Apple Music is coded as an eligible business software or operational subscription. The Business Platinum Rewards Card may support the purchase based on its larger credit-limit range, but its rewards rate was not available in the information I found.",
  "options": [
    {
      "card": "Business Gold Rewards Card",
      "best_for": "A recurring software or business-service subscription classified as operations spending",
      "rewards": "2.5% cash back on eligible operations purchases; 1.0% on other purchases",
      "estimated_cash_back_on_100000": {
        "operations_rate": "$2,500",
        "other_purchase_rate": "$1,000"
      },
      "annual_fee": "$200",
      "estimated_net_value_before_interest": {
        "operations_rate": "$2,300",
        "other_purchase_rate": "$800"
      },
      "credit_limits": "$37,500 to $225,000, subject to approval",
      "eligibility": "Minimum personal credit score of 735 and established-business PAYDEX score of 67",
      "important_note": "The rewards rate depends on the merchant category code assigned by Apple Music's payment processor, not solely on how you describe the purchase. Software subscriptions used for day-to-day operations commonly qualify, but Apple Music could instead be coded as entertainment or another non-operations category."
    },
    {
      "card": "Business Bronze Rewards Card",
      "best_for": "A lower-fee option with a new-customer promotion",
      "rewards": "1.0% cash back",
      "estimated_cash_back_on_100000": "$1,000",
      "annual_fee": "$0",
      "new_customer_promotion": "Spend $10,000 in the first 2 months to receive a $500 statement credit",
      "potential_first-year_value": "$1,500 if the purchase qualifies for the promotion and is made within the required period",
      "credit_limits": "Starting credit line of at least $10,000; the information found does not confirm that a $100,000 limit will be approved",
      "eligibility": "Minimum personal FICO score of 660; business PAYDEX may help but is not required for newer businesses"
    },
    {
      "card": "Green Rewards Card",
      "best_for": "Purchases at qualifying sustainable or eco-friendly merchants",
      "rewards": "3.0% at qualifying sustainable merchants; 1.0% on other purchases",
      "estimated_cash_back_on_100000": {
        "sustainable_merchant_rate": "$3,000",
        "other_purchase_rate": "$1,000"
      },
      "annual_fee": "$100",
      "estimated_net_value_before_interest": {
        "sustainable_merchant_rate": "$2,900",
        "other_purchase_rate": "$900"
      },
      "credit_limits": "$14,000 to $75,000, subject to approval",
      "important_note": "Because the documented maximum is $75,000, this card is not a suitable single-card solution for a $100,000 purchase unless the transaction is split and the issuer permits that arrangement. Apple Music is not documented as a qualifying sustainable merchant."
    },
    {
      "card": "Business Platinum Rewards Card",
      "best_for": "Businesses needing a larger approved credit line",
      "credit_limits": "$75,000 to $400,000, subject to approval",
      "eligibility": "Minimum personal credit score of 765 and established-business PAYDEX score of 77",
      "apr": "16.99% on carried balances",
      "rewards": "The available information confirms it is a cash-back card but does not specify the earning rate, so I cannot reliably calculate its return.",
      "important_note": "Do not apply solely for the rewards until the current rate and annual fee are confirmed in the application disclosures."
    }
  ],
  "recommendation": "If you can qualify and will pay the balance in full, start with the Business Gold Rewards Card. It has a credit-limit range capable of covering the purchase and could produce approximately $2,300 net after its annual fee if the Apple Music charge receives the 2.5% operations classification. Before relying on that estimate, confirm Apple Music's merchant category and whether the approved limit is at least $100,000.",
  "cost_warning": "Carrying the balance would materially reduce the rewards value because the Business Gold APR is 17.99% and the Business Bronze APR is 20.49%. Approval, credit limit, merchant classification, and promotional eligibility are not guaranteed."
}

{
  "acknowledgment": "That is a sound approach. Before making the purchase, confirm that your approved credit limit is at least $100,000 and verify how the Apple Music transaction is classified. At 2.5% operations cash back, the estimated net value after the $200 annual fee is $2,300; at 1.0%, it is approximately $800. Paying the balance in full will help you avoid interest charges."
}
